<title>USA: American Express Co Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>American Express Co Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.95		    $0.83</p>
<p> Net			458,000		  416,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,056,000		4,054,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 481,865		  496,516</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.68		    $2.34</p>
<p> Net		    1,307,000		1,179,000</p>
<p> Revs		  11,982,000	     11,792,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 486,554		  499,430</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company also announced it has approved a plan to repurchase 40 million common shares over the next two to three years.  </p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
